msgid ""
"Adjusts MC value used in the calculator. Use this to determine the effect on "
"estimated task time due to changes in conditions. This value will not affect "
"the main computer's setting if the dialog is exited with the Cancel button."
msgstr ""
"Juster MC-værdien i beregneren. Brug dette til at bestemme effekten af "
"ændringer i forhold på estimeret opgavetid. Denne værdi vil ikke påvirke "
"hovedcomputerens indstillinger, hvis dialogvinduet lukkes med Annuller-"
"knappen."

msgid "AAT range"
msgstr "AAT-omfang"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For AAT tasks, this value tells you how far based on the targets of your "
"task you will fly relative to the minimum and maximum possible tasks. -100% "
"indicates the minimum AAT distance. 0% is the nominal AAT distance. +100% is "
"the maximum AAT distance."
msgstr ""
"For AAT-opgaver fortæller denne værdi dig, hvor langt, baseret på målene for "
"din opgave, du vil flyve i forhold til minimum og maksimum mulige opgaver. "
"-100% angiver den mindste AAT-afstand. 0 % er den nominelle AAT-afstand. "
"+100 % er den maksimale AAT-afstand."

msgid "Speed remaining"
msgstr "Resthastighed"

msgid "Achieved MacCready"
msgstr "Realiseret MacCready"

msgid "Achieved speed"
msgstr "Realiseret hastighed"

msgid "Cruise efficiency"
msgstr "Cruisedynamiikken"

msgid ""
"Efficiency of cruise. 100 indicates perfect MacCready performance; greater "
"than 100 indicates better than MacCready performance is achieved through "
"flying in streets. Less than 100 is appropriate if you fly considerably off-"
"track. This value estimates your cruise efficiency according to the current "
"flight history with the set MC value. Calculation begins after task is "
"started."
msgstr ""
"Dyndynamik af cruisedynamiikken. 100 angiver perfekt MacCready-performans; "
"mere end 100 angiver bedre end MacCready-performans, som opnås ved at flyve "
"i gader. Mindre end 100 er passende, hvis du flyver væsentligt afstykke. "
"Dette värde estimerer din cruisedynamiikkendt i henhold til nuværende "
"fligtetablering med den angivne MC-værdi. Beregning begynder efter "
"opgavestart."

