msgid ""
"# Preflight Checks\n"
"\n"
"Before each flight, verify:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Plane & Polar** - Correct aircraft and polar selected. [Config > Plane](xcsoar://config/planes)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Flight parameters** - Wing loading, bugs, QNH, max temperature. [Info > Flight](xcsoar://dialog/flight)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Wind** - Set wind manually or enable auto wind. [Info > Wind](xcsoar://dialog/wind)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Task** - Create a task for navigation guidance. [Nav > Task Manager](xcsoar://dialog/task)"
msgstr ""
"# Preflight-tjek\n"
"\n"
"Før hver flyvning skal du kontrollere:\n"
"\n"
"1. **Plane & Polar** - Korrekt fly og polar valgt. [Config > Plane](xcsoar://config/planes)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Flyveparametre** - Vingebelastning, fejl, QNH, max temperatur. [Info > Flight](xcsoar://dialog/flight)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Vind** - Indstil vind manuelt eller aktiver automatisk vind. [Info > Wind](xcsoar://dialog/wind)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Opgave** - Opret en opgave til navigationsvejledning. [Nav > Task Manager](xcsoar://dialog/task)"

msgid ""
"# After Your Flight\n"
"\n"
"1. **Download logs** - Retrieve flight logs from your FLARM or logger device. [Config > Devices](xcsoar://config/devices)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Analysis** - Review your flight statistics. [Info > Analysis](xcsoar://dialog/analysis)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Status** - Check flight timing and statistics. [Info > Status](xcsoar://dialog/status)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Upload** - Upload to WeGlide directly from XCSoar. Configure your WeGlide User ID in [Config > System > WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide)"
msgstr ""
"# Efter din flyvning\n"
"\n"
"1. **Download logs** - Hent flylogs fra din FLARM eller logger enhed. [Config > Devices](xcsoar://config/devices)\n"
"\n"
"2. **Analyse** - Gennemgå dine flystatistikker. [Info > Analysis](xcsoar://dialog/analysis)\n"
"\n"
"3. **Status** - Tjek flyvetid og statistik. [Info > Status](xcsoar://dialog/status)\n"
"\n"
"4. **Upload** - Upload til WeGlide direkte fra XCSoar. Konfigurer dit WeGlide bruger-id i [Config > System > WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide)"

msgid ""
"![](resource:IDB_LOCATION_PIN)\n"
"\n"
"# Location Access\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar collects location data to enable flight navigation, thermal mapping, and flight logging even when the app is closed or not in use.\n"
"\n"
"- **GPS Position** - Real-time navigation and glide computer\n"
"- **Background Location** - Continuous flight recording when the screen is off or another app is in the foreground\n"
"- **Foreground Service** - Keeps GPS active during your flight\n"
"\n"
"Your location data is stored locally on your device. It is not shared unless you explicitly enable tracking in [Config > Tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking).\n"
"\n"
"[Privacy Policy](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/blob/master/PRIVACY.md)"
msgstr ""
"![](resource:IDB_LOCATION_PIN)\n"
"\n"
"# Lokationsadgang\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar indsamler lokationsdata for at aktivere flynavigation, termisk kortlægning og flylogning, selv når appen er lukket eller ikke er i brug.\n"
"\n"
"- **GPS-position** - Realtidsnavigation og glidecomputer\n"
"- **Baggrundsplacering** - Kontinuerlig flyoptagelse, når skærmen er slukket, eller en anden app er i forgrunden\n"
"- **Forgrundsservice** - Holder GPS aktiv under din flyvning\n"
"\n"
"Dine placeringsdata gemmes lokalt på din enhed. Det deles ikke, medmindre du udtrykkeligt aktiverer sporing i [Config > Tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking).\n"
"\n"
"[Privacy Policy](https://github.com/XCSoar/XCSoar/blob/master/PRIVACY.md)"

msgid ""
"![](resource:IDB_NOTIFICATION_BELL)\n"
"\n"
"# Notifications\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar needs notification permission to maintain a persistent notification while recording your flight. This notification is required by Android for background operation and provides a quick way to return to the app.\n"
"\n"
"Without this permission, Android may stop flight recording when the app is in the background."
msgstr ""
"![](resource:IDB_NOTIFICATION_BELL)\n"
"\n"
"# Meddelelser\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar har brug for meddelelsestilladelse for at opretholde en vedvarende meddelelse, mens du optager din flyvning. Denne meddelelse er påkrævet af Android til baggrundsbetjening og giver en hurtig måde at vende tilbage til appen.\n"
"\n"
"Uden denne tilladelse kan Android stoppe flyoptagelsen, når appen er i baggrunden."

msgid ""
"# XCSoar Cloud\n"
"\n"
"The XCSoar project offers a service that allows sharing thermal and wave locations with other pilots in real time.\n"
"\n"
"If you participate, your **position**, **thermal/wave locations** and other weather data will be transmitted to the XCSoar Cloud server.\n"
"\n"
"You can change this at any time in [Config > Tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking)."
msgstr ""
"# XCSoar Cloud\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar-projektet tilbyder en service, der gør det muligt at dele termiske og bølgelokaliteter med andre piloter i realtid.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis du deltager, vil din **position**, **termiske/bølgeplaceringer** og andre vejrdata blive transmitteret til XCSoar Cloud-serveren.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan til enhver tid ændre dette i [Config > Tracking](xcsoar://config/tracking)."

