#, no-c-format
msgid "Altitude GPS"
msgstr "Højde GPS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt GPS"
msgstr "Højde GPS"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Altitude above mean sea level reported by the GPS. (Touch-screen/PC only) In "
"simulation mode, this value is adjustable with the up/down arrow keys; the "
"right/left arrow keys cause the glider to turn."
msgstr ""
"Højde over merselandsniveau rapporteret af GPS. (Tastatur/PC kun) I "
"simuleringstilstand justeres denne værdi med hjælp af op/ned-piletaster; "
"vandret/forsvendt piletaster gør gliderturen vende."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Height AGL"
msgstr "Højde AGL"

#, no-c-format
msgid "H AGL"
msgstr "H AGL"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Navigation altitude minus the terrain elevation obtained from the terrain "
"file. The value is coloured red when the glider is below the terrain safety "
"clearance height."
msgstr ""
"Dette er navigationshøjden minus terrænhøjden fra terrænfilen. Værdien er "
"rød, når flyet er under den klarerede sikkerhedshøjde."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal climb, last 30 s"
msgstr "Termikløft, sidste 30 s"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC 30s"
msgstr "TC 30 [s]"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"30-second rolling average climb rate based on reported GPS altitude, or "
"vario if available. The number in smaller font reflects the climb rate for "
"the current thermal since circling started."
msgstr ""
"30 sekunders løbende gennemsnitsstig baseret på rapportered GPS højde, eller "
"variometer hvis tilsluttet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next bearing"
msgstr "Næste kurs"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"True bearing of the next waypoint. For AAT tasks, this is the true bearing "
"to the target within the AAT sector."
msgstr ""
"Sand kurs til næste vendpunkt. For AAT opgaver er det sand kurs til punktet "
"inden i sektoren."

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR instantaneous"
msgstr "GR instantané"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR Inst"
msgstr "GR Indstilling"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous glide ratio over ground, given by the ground speed divided by "
"the vertical speed (GPS speed) over the last 20 seconds. Negative values "
"indicate climbing cruise. If the vertical speed is close to zero, the "
"displayed value is '---'."
msgstr ""
"Genstandsgyldighed over jord i det nuværende øjeblik, beregnet som farten "
"over jorden divideret med den vertikale hastighed (GPS-fart) de sidste 20 "
"sekunder. Negativ værdier indikerer flydende krysseløft. Hvis den vertikale "
"hastighed er nær null, vises værdien '---'."

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR cruise"
msgstr "GR kryssningsflyvning"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR Cruise"
msgstr "GR Cru"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Distance from the top of the last thermal, divided by the altitude lost "
"since the top of the last thermal. Negative values indicate climbing cruise "
"(height gain since leaving the last thermal). If the vertical speed is close "
"to zero, the displayed value is '---'."
msgstr ""
"Avstand til toppen af sidste termik delt ved højden tabt siden toppen af "
"sidste termik. Negativ værdier indikerer flydende krysseløft (højdevinder "
"siden gliderturen forlod sidste termik). Hvis den vertikale hastighed er nær "
"null, vises værdien '---'."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed ground"
msgstr "Ground Speed"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V GND"
msgstr "V Gnd"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ground speed measured by the GPS. The small value shows the head or tail "
"wind difference to TAS for the current vector. If this InfoBox is active in "
"simulation mode, pressing the up and down arrows adjusts the speed, and left "
"and right turn the glider."
msgstr ""
"Ground speed målt af GPSen. Hvis InfoBoks er aktiv i simulerings mode så vil "
"up/ned pilene justere hastigheden og venstre/højre dreje flyet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Last thermal average"
msgstr "Sidste gennemsnitsstig"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TL Avg"
msgstr "TL Avg"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Total altitude gain/loss in the last thermal divided by the time spent "
"circling."
msgstr ""
"Total højde- vinding/tab i sidste termikboble divideret med tiden i "
"termikken."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Last thermal gain"
msgstr "Sidste højdevinding"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TL Gain"
msgstr "TL Vundenskæring"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Total altitude gain/loss in the last thermal. The number in smaller font "
"reflects the overall climb rate for the last thermal."
msgstr ""
"Total højde- vinding/tab i sidste termikboble divideret med tiden i "
"termikken."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Last thermal duration"
msgstr "Sidste termiks varighed"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TL duration"
msgstr "TL Varighed"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time spent circling in the last thermal."
msgstr "Forbrugt tid i sidste termik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "MacCready setting"
msgstr "MacCready indstilling"

#, no-c-format
msgid "MC"
msgstr "MC"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Current MacCready setting and mode (manual or auto). (Touch-screen/PC only) "
"When this InfoBox is active, use the up/down cursor keys to adjust the "
"MacCready setting."
msgstr ""
"Nuværende MacCready-indstillinger og -tilstand (manuelt eller automatisk). "
"(Tastatur/PC kun) Når denne InfoBox er aktiveret, justeres MacCready-"
"indstillingen med hjælp af op/ned-piletaster."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next distance"
msgstr "Næste distance"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP Dist"
msgstr "WP Dist"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Distance to the currently selected waypoint. For AAT tasks, this is the "
"distance to the target within the AAT sector."
msgstr ""
"Afstanden til det valgte vendepunkt. For AAT opgaver er det afstanden til "
"punket i AAT sektoren"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next altitude difference"
msgstr "Næste højdedifferens"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP AltD"
msgstr "WP Højdedifferance"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Arrival altitude at the next waypoint relative to the safety arrival height. "
"For AAT tasks, the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr ""
"Ankommelshøjde til næste vejpunkt relativt sikker ankommelshøjde. For AAT "
"opgaver bruges målet inden i AAT-sektoren."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next altitude required"
msgstr "Næste højdebehov"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP AltR"
msgstr "WP HjR"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additional altitude required to reach the next turn point. For AAT tasks, "
"the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr ""
"Yderligere højde krævet for at nå næste vendepunkt. For AAT opgaver bruges "
"målet inden i AAT-sektoren."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next waypoint"
msgstr "Næste vendepunkt"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next WP"
msgstr "Næste WP"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Name of the currently selected turn point. When this InfoBox is active, "
"using the up/down cursor keys selects the next/previous waypoint in the "
"task. (Touch-screen/PC only) Pressing the enter cursor key brings up the "
"Airfields/waypoint details."
msgstr ""
"Navn på det nuværende valgte vendepunkt. Når denne InfoBox er aktive, vil "
"brug af tastaturkurzene op og ned vælge næste/forrige vejpunkt i opgaven. "
"(Kun tilhørs- eller PC-værktøj) Tryk på enter-tasten for at udkomme "
"Airfields/vejpunkts detaljer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final altitude difference"
msgstr "Endelig højde difference"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin AltD"
msgstr "Fin HjD"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Arrival altitude at the final task turn point relative to the safety arrival "
"height."
msgstr "Ankomsthøjden til ankomstpunktet relativ til sikkerhedshøjden."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final altitude required"
msgstr "Nødvendig ankomsthøjde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin AltR"
msgstr "Fin HjR"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional altitude required to finish the task."
msgstr "Yderlig højde nødvendig for at afslutte opgave"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task average"
msgstr "Hastighedstævning"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task Avg"
msgstr "V Tævning"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Average cross-country speed while on current task, not compensated for "
"altitude."
msgstr ""
"Gennemsnitlige længdeflyvingshastighed under nuværende opgave, ikke justeret "
"for højde."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final distance"
msgstr "Slutafstand"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin Dist"
msgstr "Slutafstand"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to finish around remaining turn points."
msgstr "Afstand til afslutning mellem de resterende vendepunkter."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terrain elevation"
msgstr "Terrainhøjde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terr Elev"
msgstr "TerrHj"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Elevation of the terrain above mean sea level, obtained from the terrain "
"file at the current GPS location."
msgstr ""
"Højden af terrainen over merselv, opnået fra terrainfilen ved nuværende GPS-"
"lokation."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal average"
msgstr "Termikstævning"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Avg"
msgstr "TC Tævning"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Altitude gained/lost in the current thermal, divided by time spent "
"thermalling."
msgstr "Højdevundet/tid i den nuværende termik delt af tid brugt thermalling."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal gain"
msgstr "Termikgånd"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Gain"
msgstr "TC Vinding"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altitude gained/lost in the current thermal."
msgstr "Total højde- vinding/tab i sidste termikboble"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Magnetic track reported by the GPS. (Touch-screen/PC only) If this InfoBox "
"is active in simulation mode, pressing the up/down arrows adjusts the track."
msgstr ""
"Magnetisk kurs, som rapporteres af GPS. (Tastatur/PC kun) Hvis denne InfoBox "
"er aktiv i simulationsmodus, justerer tryk på op/ned-piletaster den kurven."

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous vertical speed, as reported by the GPS, or the intelligent "
"vario total energy vario value if connected to one."
msgstr ""
"Genstandsværdig fart, som rapporteres af GPS, eller intelligent vario totals "
"energi vario værdien, hvis det er forbundet med et."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind speed"
msgstr "Vindhastighed"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind speed estimated by XCSoar. Manual adjustment is possible with the connected InfoBox dialogue. Pressing the up/down cursor keys to cycle through settings, adjust the values with left/right cursor keys."
msgstr "Vindfart estimérer XCSoar. Manuelt justering er muligt ved hjælp af InfoBox-dialogen. Tryk på op/ned-piletaster for at gennemgå indstillingerne, og juster værdierne ved hjælp af venstre/højre piletaster."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind bearing"
msgstr "Vindbearing"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wind bearing estimated by XCSoar. Manual adjustment is possible with the "
"connected InfoBox dialogue. Pressing the up/down cursor keys to cycle "
"through settings, adjust the values with left/right cursor keys."
msgstr ""
"Vindbearing estimérer XCSoar. Manuelt justering er muligt ved hjælp af "
"InfoBox-dialogen. Tryk på op/ned-piletaster for at gennemgå indstillingerne, "
"og juster værdierne ved hjælp af venstre/højre piletaster."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT time"
msgstr "AAT tid"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Time"
msgstr "AAT Tid"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task time remaining. Goes red when time remaining has expired."
msgstr ""
"Overrestet arealopgaves tid tilbage. Bliver rød, når resterende tid har "
"udløbet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT max. distance "
msgstr "AAT maksimal distans"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Dmax"
msgstr "AAT Dmax"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigned Area Task maximum distance possible for remainder of task."
msgstr "Maksimal arealopgave distans mulig for resten af opgaven."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT min. distance"
msgstr "AAT minimum distans"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Dmin"
msgstr "AAT Dmin"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigned Area Task minimum distance possible for remainder of task."
msgstr "Minimum arealopgave distans mulig for resten af opgaven."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT speed max. distance"
msgstr "AAT hastighed maksimal distans"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Vmax"
msgstr "AAT Vmax"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task average speed achievable if flying maximum possible "
"distance remaining in minimum AAT time."
msgstr ""
"Gennemsnitlig arealopgaves hastighed, der kan opnås ved at flyve maximum "
"muligt distancer i minimum AAT tid."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT speed min. distance"
msgstr "AAT hastighed minimum distans"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Vmin"
msgstr "AAT Vmin"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task average speed achievable if flying minimum possible "
"distance remaining in minimum AAT time."
msgstr ""
"Attribueret områdeopgave gennemsnitlige hastighed, hvis man flyver minimum "
"mulige afstand i minimum AAT-tid."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airspeed IAS"
msgstr "Hastsomløb IAS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V IAS"
msgstr "V TAS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Indicated Airspeed reported by a supported external intelligent vario."
msgstr ""
"Indikerede hastsomløb fra understøttet ekstern intelligente variometer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Barometric altitude"
msgstr "Barometrisk højde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt Baro"
msgstr "Højdebarometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Barometric altitude obtained from a device equipped with a pressure sensor."
msgstr "Barometrisk højde opnået fra en enhed udstyret med en tryksensor."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed MacCready"
msgstr "Hastighed MacCready"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V MC"
msgstr "V Kurs"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"MacCready speed-to-fly for optimal flight to the next waypoint. In cruise "
"flight mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for maintaining altitude. In "
"final glide mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for descent."
msgstr ""
"MacCready hastighed til flyve for optimalt flyve til næste vejpunkt. I "
"luftfartmodus beregnes denne flyvehastighed for at holde på højden. I "
"slutglid modus beregnes denne flyvehastighed for at desender."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Percentage climb"
msgstr "Procentdel af stigningsmodus"

#, no-c-format
msgid "% Climb"
msgstr "% Climb"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Percentage of time spent in climb mode. These statistics are reset upon "
"starting the task."
msgstr ""
"Procentdel af tid, der er blevet brugt i stigningsmodus. Disse statistikker "
"resettes ved start af opgaven."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Flight duration"
msgstr "Flidsvarighedstid"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Flt Duration"
msgstr "Flt Varighed"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time elapsed since takeoff was detected."
msgstr "Tid, der har gået siden det opfattede tagning blev registreret."

#, no-c-format
msgid "G load"
msgstr "G-ladning"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Magnitude of G loading reported by a supported external intelligent vario. "
"This value is negative for pitch-down manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"Magnituden af G-ladningen rapporteret fra understøttet ekstern intelligente "
"variometer. Dette værdi er negativ for pitch-down manøvrer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next GR"
msgstr "Næste glidetal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP GR"
msgstr "WP GL"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Required glide ratio over ground to reach the next waypoint, given by the "
"distance to the next waypoint divided by the height required to arrive at "
"the safety arrival height."
msgstr ""
"Pågældende glidetal over jord til at nå næste vejpunkt, angivet ved "
"afstanden til næste vejpunkt divideret med højden der kræves for at når "
"sikker arrivalehøjde."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time local"
msgstr "Tid lokal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time loc"
msgstr "Tid loc"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GPS time expressed in local time zone."
msgstr "GPS-tid udført i lokale tid."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time UTC"
msgstr "Tid UTC"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GPS time expressed in UTC."
msgstr "GPS-tid udført i UTC."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task time to go"
msgstr "Opgavetid tilbage"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin ETE"
msgstr "Fin TID"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated time required to complete task, assuming performance of ideal "
"MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Estimerede tid krævet for at afslutte opgave, antageligt med ideal MacCready-"
"cruise/climb cyklus."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next time to go"
msgstr "Næste tid tilbage"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETE"
msgstr "WP TID"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated time required to reach next waypoint, assuming performance of "
"ideal MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Estimerede tid krævet for at nå næste vejpunkt, antageligt med ideal "
"MacCready-cruise/climb cyklus."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed dolphin"
msgstr "Hastighed dolphin"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous MacCready speed-to-fly, making use of netto vario calculations "
"to determine dolphin cruise speed on the glider's current track. In cruise "
"flight mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for maintaining altitude. In "
"final glide mode, this speed-to-fly is calculated for descent. In climb "
"mode, this switches to the speed for minimum sink at the current load factor "
"(if an accelerometer is connected). When Block mode speed-to-fly is "
"selected, this InfoBox displays the MacCready speed."
msgstr ""
"Instantané MacCready-hastighed til flyve, der bruger netto vario-værdier til "
"at bestemme dolphin-cruisehastigheden på glidernes nuværende rute. I "
"cruiseflugtilstand beregnes denne hastighed til flyve for at holde højde. I "
"slutglidetilstand beregnes denne hastighed til flyve for descent. I "
"stigtilstand byttes dette til hastigheden med minimumsink på nuværende "
"belastningsfaktor (hvis en accelerometer er forbundet). Når Block-"
"tillstandes hastighed til flyve er valgt, viser denne InfoBox MacCready-"
"hastigheden."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto vario"
msgstr "Netto variometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto"
msgstr "Net"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous vertical speed of air-mass, equal to vario value less the "
"glider's estimated sink rate. Best used if airspeed, accelerometers and "
"vario are connected, otherwise calculations are based on GPS measurements "
"and wind estimates."
msgstr ""
"Instantané vertikalspeed af luftmassen, lig med vario-værdi minus glidernes "
"estimerede sinkrate. Bedst bruget hvis airspeed, accelerometers og vario er "
"forbundet, ellers beregnes de baseret på GPS-målede data og vindestimeringer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task arrival time"
msgstr "Opgavetid for ankomst"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin ETA"
msgstr "Fin ETA"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated arrival local time at task completion, assuming performance of "
"ideal MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Estimateret ankomsttid lokal tid, antageligt for ideal MacCready-cruise/"
"clykcyklus."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next arrival time"
msgstr "Næste ankomsttid"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETA"
msgstr "Vejpunkt ETA"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Estimated arrival local time at next waypoint, assuming performance of ideal "
"MacCready cruise/climb cycle."
msgstr ""
"Estimateret ankomsttid til næste vejpunkt, antageligt for ideal MacCready-"
"cruise/clykcyklus."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Bearing difference"
msgstr "Kursforskning"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Brng D"
msgstr "Kurs D"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Difference between the glider's track (direction of motion across the "
"ground) and the bearing to the next waypoint, or for AAT tasks, the bearing "
"to the target within the AAT sector. GPS navigation is based on the track, "
"and the track may differ from the glider's heading when there is wind. "
"Chevrons point to the direction the glider needs to alter course to correct "
"the bearing difference, that is, to make it so that the glider is tracking "
"directly toward the next waypoint. This calculation accounts for the "
"curvature of the Earth."
msgstr ""
"Forskellen mellem svæveflugtsbanen (retningen over jorden) og kortheden til "
"næste vejpunkt, eller for AAT-opgaver, kortheden til målet inden i AAT-"
"sektoren. GPS-navigering baseres på banen, og banen kan forskelne fra "
"svæveflugtskursen, når der er vind. Piletter peger mod retningen, hvori "
"svæveflyet skal ændre kurs for at korrigere korthedsforskningen, dvs. for at "
"sikre, at svæveflyet flyver direkte mod næste vejpunkt. Denne beregning "
"tager højde for jordens kurv."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Outside air temperature"
msgstr "Udløbslufttemperatur"

#, no-c-format
msgid "OAT"
msgstr "OAT"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Outside air temperature measured by a probe if supported by a connected "
"intelligent variometer."
msgstr ""
"Udløbslufttemperatur målt af en probe, hvis intelligent variometer er "
"forbundet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Relative humidity"
msgstr "Relativ luftfugtighed"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Rel Hum"
msgstr "Relativ Luftfugtighed"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Relative humidity of the air in percent as measured by a probe if supported "
"by a connected intelligent variometer."
msgstr ""
"Luftfugtigheden i procent som målt af en probe, hvis intelligent variometer "
"er forbundet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Max Temp"
msgstr "Maksimal Temperatur"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Forecast temperature of the ground at the home airfield, used in estimating "
"convection height and cloud base in conjunction with outside air temperature "
"and relative humidity probe. (Touch-screen/PC only) Pressing the up/down "
"cursor keys adjusts this forecast temperature."
msgstr ""
"Prognose temperatur på jorden ved hjemmelandsflygbasen, bruges til at "
"estimerer convection højde og skybase i forbindelse med udkast temperatur og "
"relæt luftfugtighedsprobedelesnivå. (Tastatur/PC kun) Tryk på op/ned tastene "
"justerer denne prognose temperatur."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT distance around target"
msgstr "AAT afstand omkring mål"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Dtgt"
msgstr "AAT Driftsdestinering"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigned Area Task distance around target points for remainder of task."
msgstr "AAT distance around target points for remainder of task."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT speed around target"
msgstr "AAT hastighed omkring mål"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT Vtgt"
msgstr "AAT Velosteretarget"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Assigned Area Task average speed achievable around target points remaining "
"in minimum AAT time."
msgstr ""
"AAT average speed achievable around target points remaining in minimum AAT "
"time."

#, no-c-format
msgid "L/D vario"
msgstr "L/D variometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid "L/D Vario"
msgstr "L/D Variometer"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous lift/drag ratio, given by the indicated airspeed divided by "
"the total energy vertical speed, when connected to an intelligent "
"variometer. Negative values indicate climbing cruise. If the total energy "
"vario speed is close to zero, the displayed value is '---'."
msgstr ""
"Genstandsværdig løft/dragforhold, givet ved flydende luftfart opdeledd med "
"den totale energi vertikalspeed, når det er forbundet til en intelligent "
"variometer. Negativ værdier indikerer klimacruise. Hvis den totale energi "
"variometerhastighed nærmer sig nul, vises værdien '---'."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Airspeed TAS"
msgstr "Flydende luftfart TAS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V TAS"
msgstr "V HASTETHET"

#, no-c-format
msgid "True Airspeed reported by a supported external intelligent vario."
msgstr ""
"Virkelige luftfart rapporteret af et understøttet intelligent variometer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team code"
msgstr "Tjekkencode"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Current Team code for this aircraft. Use this to report to other team "
"members. The last team aircraft code entered is displayed underneath."
msgstr ""
"Nuværende tjekkodenummer for dette fly. Brug dette til at rapportere til "
"andre medlemmer i samme team. Det sidste indtastede tjekkodenummer for dit "
"fly vises nederst."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team bearing"
msgstr "Tjekkbearing"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team Brng"
msgstr "Tjebearng"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Bearing to the team aircraft location at the last team code report."
msgstr ""
"Kurs til placeringen af teamets fly ved den sidste rapporterede "
"tjekkodenummer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team bearing difference"
msgstr "Tjekkbearing forskel"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team BrngD"
msgstr "TjebearngD"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Relative bearing to the team aircraft location at the last reported team "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Relativ kurs til placeringen af teamets fly ved den sidste rapporterede "
"tjekkodenummer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team range"
msgstr "Tjekkrækkevidde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Team Dist"
msgstr "Tjedistans"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Range to the team aircraft location at the last reported team code."
msgstr ""
"Rækkevidde til placeringen af teamets fly ved den sidste rapporterede "
"tjekkodenummer."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task instantaneous"
msgstr "HASTIGHEDSOPGAVE INSTANTANEOUS"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task Inst"
msgstr "V OPGAVE Inst"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instantaneous cross-country speed while on current task, compensated for "
"altitude. Equivalent to instantaneous Pirker cross-country speed."
msgstr ""
"Instantané cross-countryhastighed under nuværende opgave, justeret for "
"højde. Equivalent til instantané Pirker cross-countryhastighed."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance home"
msgstr "Afstand hjemme"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Home Dist"
msgstr "Hjem Dist"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to home waypoint (if defined)."
msgstr "Afstand til hjemmevejpunkt (hvis defineret)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed task achieved"
msgstr "Hastighed opgave nået"

#, no-c-format
msgid "V Task Ach"
msgstr "V Opgave Nægt"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Achieved cross-country speed while on current task, compensated for "
"altitude. Equivalent to Pirker cross-country speed remaining."
msgstr ""
"Opnåd længdeflyvning under nuværende opgave, justeret for højde. Equivalent "
"til Pirker længdeflyvning rest."

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT delta time"
msgstr "AAT delta tid"

#, no-c-format
msgid "AAT dT"
msgstr "AAT dT"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Difference between estimated task time and AAT minimum time. Coloured red if "
"negative (expected arrival too early), or blue if in sector and can turn now "
"with estimated arrival time greater than AAT time plus 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Udenfor skuespil og kan snibe nu med estimerede ankomsttid, hvis den er mere "
"end 5 minutter over AAT-tiden."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal average over all"
msgstr "Gennemsnitlig termik"

#, no-c-format
msgid "T Avg"
msgstr "T Gnsn"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time-average climb rate in all thermals."
msgstr ""
"Tidsbasert gennemsnitlig stigningshastighed i alle termiske luftstrømme."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task req. total height trend"
msgstr "Opgavereq. total højde tendens"

#, no-c-format
msgid "RH Trend"
msgstr "RH Tendens"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Trend (or neg. of the variation) of the total required height to complete "
"the task."
msgstr ""
"Tendens (eller negativ variering) af den totale krævede højde til at "
"fuldføre opgaven."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Battery percent"
msgstr "Akkuprocent"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Percentage of device battery remaining (where applicable) and status/voltage "
"of external power supply."
msgstr ""
"Procentvis resten af enhedsakkupas status/volt for ekstern strømforlystning "
"(hvor relevant)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Final GR"
msgstr "Slut glidetal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin GR"
msgstr "Slutglid Tal"

#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Required glide ratio over ground to finish the task, given by the distance "
"to go divided by the height required to arrive at the safety arrival height."
msgstr ""
"Krævede glidetal over jord for at færdiggøre opgaven, beregnet som afstanden "
"til at gå divideret med den højde der kræves for at ankomme sikker "
"ankomsthøjden."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 1"
msgstr "Alternativ 1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 1"
msgstr "Højde 1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Name and bearing to the best alternate landing location."
msgstr "Navn og bånd til den bedste yderliggørelseslandningsted."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 2"
msgstr "Alternativ 2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 2"
msgstr "Højde 2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Name and bearing to the second-best alternate landing location."
msgstr "Navn og bånd til det anden bedste yderliggørelseslandningsted."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate 1 GR"
msgstr "Alternativ 1 GR"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altn 1 GR"
msgstr "Højde 1 glidetal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Geometric gradient to the arrival height above the best alternate landing location. This is not adjusted for total energy."
msgstr "Geometrisk gradient til ankomsthøjde over det bedste yderliggørelseslandningsted. Dette justeres ikke for samlet energi."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Height above take-off"
msgstr "Højde fra start"

#, no-c-format
msgid "H T/O"
msgstr "Højde T/O"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Height based on an automatic take-off reference elevation (like a QFE reference)."
msgstr "Højde baseret på en automatisk startreferencerælev (som QFE)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR average"
msgstr "GR gennemsnit"

#, no-c-format
msgid "GR Avg"
msgstr "GR Gns"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance flown during the configured averaging period divided by the altitude lost during that period. Negative values are shown as ^^^ and indicate climbing cruise (height gain). For GR >200, the value is shown as +++. You can configure the averaging period in the system setup (suggested: 60, 90 or 120s). Lower values will be closer to GR Inst, and higher values will be closer to GR Cruise. Note: The distance is not the straight line between your previous and current positions; it is the actual path distance flown (including zigzags). This value is not calculated while circling."
msgstr "Flytt afstovet under konfigureret gennemsnittsperiode divideret med den højt mistede højde under denne periode. Negative værdier vises som ^^^ og angiver klimerundt (højdepåvægt). For GR >200, vises værdien som +++. Du kan konfigurere gennemsnittsperioden i systemindstillingerne (forstedet: 60, 90 eller 120 s). Lavere værdier vil være nærmere GR Inst, og højere værdier vil være nærmere GR Cruise. Note: Distancen er ikke den rette linje mellem dit forrige og nuværende position; det er faktisk flytt afstovet (inkluderende zigzags). Dette värde beregnes ikke under rundning."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Experimental 1"
msgstr "Experimentel 1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Exp1"
msgstr "Experiment1"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Contest distance"
msgstr "Næste distance"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Cont Dist"
msgstr "WP Dist"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Instantaneous evaluation of the flown distance according to the configured Contest rule set."
msgstr "Instantané vurdering af flytt efter konfigurerede regler for konkurrence."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Experimental 2"
msgstr "Experimentel 2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Exp2"
msgstr "Experiment2"

#, no-c-format
msgid "CPU load"
msgstr "CPU-lastload"

#, no-c-format
msgid "CPU"
msgstr "CPU"

#, no-c-format
msgid "CPU load consumed by XCSoar averaged over 5 seconds."
msgstr "CPU-lastload for XCSoar gennemsnit over 5 sekunder."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next altitude arrival"
msgstr "Næste højdearrive"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP AltA"
msgstr "WP HjA"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Absolute arrival altitude at the next waypoint in final glide. For AAT tasks, the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr "Sand kurs til næste vendpunkt. For AAT opgaver er det sand kurs til punktet inden i sektoren."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Free RAM"
msgstr "Ledig RAM"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Free RAM as reported by OS."
msgstr "Ledig RAM som rapporteret af operativsystem."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Flight level"
msgstr "Flightråd"

#, no-c-format
msgid "FL"
msgstr "FL"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Pressure Altitude given as Flight Level. If barometric altitude is not available, FL is calculated from GPS altitude, given that the correct QNH is set. In case the FL is calculated from the GPS altitude, the FL label is coloured red."
msgstr "Trykshøjde angivet som Flightråd. Hvis trykshøjden ikke er tilgængelig, beregnes FL fra GPS-shøjden, givet korrekt QNH er sat. I tilfældet hvor FL beregnes fra GPS-shøjden, markeres FL-mærket rødt."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Barogram"
msgstr "Barografi"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of altitude during flight."
msgstr "Spor af højde under flugt."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Vario trace"
msgstr "Vario-spor"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Vario Trace"
msgstr "Vario-Spor"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of vertical speed, as reported by the GPS, or the intelligent vario total energy vario value if connected to one."
msgstr "Spor over vandret hastighed, som rapporteres af GPS eller intelligent vario totalenergi-vario værdi hvis det er forbundet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto vario trace"
msgstr "Netto-variospor"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Netto Trace"
msgstr "Netto-Spor"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of vertical speed of air-mass, equal to vario value less the glider's estimated sink rate."
msgstr "Spor over vandret hastighed for luftmassen, ligegyldig med at variovarien eller GPS-shøjden bruges."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal climb trace"
msgstr "Termikklomspor"

#, no-c-format
msgid "TC Trace"
msgstr "TC-Spor"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Trace of average climb rate each turn in circling, based of the reported GPS altitude, or vario if available."
msgstr "Spor over gennemsnitlig klomerhastighed i kringflug baseret på rapporterede GPS-højde, eller variovarien hvis det er tilgængeligt."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Climb band"
msgstr "Klommsband"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Climb Band"
msgstr "Stigband"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Graph of average circling climb rate (horizontal axis) as a function of altitude (vertical axis)."
msgstr "Graf over gennemsnitlige kringflugstigerhastighed (horisontal akse) som funktion af højde (vertikal akse)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task progress"
msgstr "Opgaveforløb"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Progress"
msgstr "Forløb"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Clock-like display of distance remaining along task, showing achieved task points."
msgstr "Klokkeformet visning af restafstand langs opgave, vist med opnåede opgavepunkter."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Time under max. start height"
msgstr "Tid under maksimal starthøjde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start Height"
msgstr "Starthøjde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Contiguous period during which the aircraft has been below the task start maximum height."
msgstr "Kontinuerlig periode, under hvilken flytten er været under den maksimale opgavestarthøjde."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task time to go (ground speed)"
msgstr "Opgavetid til gåen (jordhastighed)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Fin ETE VMG"
msgstr "Slut ETE VMG"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Estimated time required to complete task, assuming current ground speed is maintained."
msgstr "Forudsigelse af tid, der kræves for at fuldføre opgaven, antagende, at den nuværende jordhastighed beholder sig."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next time to go (ground speed)"
msgstr "Neste tid til gåen (jordhastighed)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP ETE VMG"
msgstr "WPT ETE VMG"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Estimated time required to reach next waypoint, assuming current ground speed is maintained."
msgstr "Forudsigelse af tid, der kræves for at nå næste vejpunkt, antagende, at den nuværende jordhastighed beholder sig."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Attitude indicator"
msgstr "Attitudemåler"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Attitude indicator (artificial horizon) display calculated from flight path, supplemented with acceleration and variometer data if available."
msgstr "Attitudemåler (kunstig horisont) visning beregnet fra flytrapen, uddybelsesvis med acceleration og variometerdata, hvis tilgængelige."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest airspace horizontal"
msgstr "Nærmeste luftrums horisontal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Near AS H"
msgstr "Naarmest AS H"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Horizontal distance to the nearest airspace."
msgstr "Horisontal afstand til nærmeste luftrum."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest airspace vertical"
msgstr "Nærmeste luftrums vertikal"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Near AS V"
msgstr "Nærmeste AS V"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Vertical distance to the nearest airspace. A positive value means the airspace is above you; a negative value means the airspace is below you."
msgstr "Vertikalt afstand til næstede luftrum. En positiv værdi betyder, at luftrummet er over dig; en negativ værdi betyder, at luftrummet er under dig."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next MC0 altitude difference"
msgstr "Næste MC0 højdeforskning"

#, no-c-format
msgid "WP MC0 AltD"
msgstr "WP MC0 GlidD"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Arrival altitude at the next waypoint with MC 0 setting relative to the safety arrival height. For AAT tasks, the target within the AAT sector is used."
msgstr "Ankomsthøjden til ankomstpunktet relativ til sikkerhedshøjden."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind, head component"
msgstr "Vind, hovedkomponent"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Head Wind"
msgstr "Hovedvind"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Current head wind component. Head wind is calculated from TAS and GPS ground speed if airspeed is available from an external device; otherwise, the estimated wind is used."
msgstr "Nuværende hovedvindkomponent. Hovedvind beregnes fra TAS og GPS jordhastighed, hvis luftfart er tilgængelig fra et eksternt enhed; ellers bruges estimerede vind."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terrain collision"
msgstr "Terrain-kollision"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Terr Coll"
msgstr "Bjergkollision"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Distance to the next terrain collision along the current task leg. At this location, the altitude will be below the configured terrain clearance altitude."
msgstr "Afstand til næste terrain-kollision langs nuværende opgaveleg. Her vil højden være under konfigureret terrain-friheds-højde."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Altitude (Auto)"
msgstr "Højde (Automatisk)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Alt Auto"
msgstr "Højde automatisk"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Barometric altitude obtained from a device equipped with a pressure sensor, or GPS altitude if barometric altitude is not available."
msgstr "Barometrisk højde, der opnås fra en enhed med trykssensor, eller GPS højde, hvis barometrisk højde ikke er tilgængelig."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal next leg equivalent"
msgstr "Termik næste leg ekvivalent"

#, no-c-format
msgid "T Next Leg"
msgstr "T Næste Leg"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Thermal climb rate on the next leg that is equivalent to a thermal climb rate equal to the MacCready setting on the current leg."
msgstr "Termisk stigfart på næste leg, der er ekvivalent med termisk stigfart, ligesom MacCready-indstillingerne på nuværende leg."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Wind, head component (simplified)"
msgstr "Vind, hovedkomponent (simplificeret)"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Head Wind *"
msgstr "Hovedvind *"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Current head wind component. The simplified head wind is calculated by subtracting GPS ground speed from TAS if airspeed is available from an external device."
msgstr "Nuværende hovedvindkomponent. Den simplificerede hovedvind beregnes ved at trække GPS jordhastighed fra TAS, hvis luftfart er tilgængelig fra et eksternt enhed."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Task cruise efficiency"
msgstr "Opgavekruiseeffektivitet"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Cruise Eff"
msgstr "Cruiseskift"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Efficiency of cruise. 100 indicates perfect MacCready performance. This value estimates your cruise efficiency according to the current flight history with the set MC value. Calculation begins after task is started."
msgstr "Efficiensen af cruisedrift. 100 angiver perfekt MacCready prestation. Dette værdi beregner din cruiserelevans i henhold til nuværende fligthistorik med den indstillede MC-værdi. Beregning begynder efter at opgaven er startet."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Circular thermal assistant that shows the lift distribution over each part of the circle."
msgstr "Kringløftshjælper der viser lufthåndslen over hvert af kringloftets dele."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start open/close countdown"
msgstr "Start åbne/tomte tæller"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start open"
msgstr "Start åben"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start open/close countdown at reaching"
msgstr "Start åbne/tomte tæller ved nåde"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Start reach"
msgstr "Start nåd"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Next radial"
msgstr "Næste radial"

#, no-c-format
msgid "True bearing from the next waypoint to your position."
msgstr "Sandvinkel fra næste vejpunkt til din position."

#, no-c-format
msgid "ATC radial"
