msgid "Tells XCSoar to send its current GPS position to the device as $GPGGA and $GPRMC sentences. Turn off when another GPS source is already feeding the device on the same line. Changes take effect after reconnecting the device."
msgstr ""
"Säger åt XCSoar at skicka sin aktuella GPS-position till enheten som $GPGGA-"
" og $GPRMC-meningar. Stäng av ner en annan GPS-källa redan matar enheten på "
"samma linje. Ändringar gäller efter återanslutning."

msgid "Synchronize the glide polar between XCSoar and the device (LXNAV varios). 'Receive' adopts the polar from the device (e.g. for club gliders). 'Send' pushes XCSoar's polar to the device."
msgstr ""
"Synkronisera glidpolaren mellan XCSoar og enheten (LXNAV-variometrar). 'Ta "
"emot' hämtar polaren fra enheten (t.ex. for klubbfly). 'Skicka' skickar "
"XCSoars polar till enheten."

